          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.95" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A reduction in the physical flow of crude, diesel or LNG tightens near-term supply relative to demand and pushes up cash (spot) prices for oil and refined fuels." />
