          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A rise in successful attacks on production, refining or export nodes elevates insurance and transport risk premia and can degrade local processing capacity, which raises delivered oil and diesel prices even beyond direct supply metrics." />
