          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rising tanker charter rates increase shipping costs and freight-rate uncertainty, prompting firms to cut or reroute shipments and reducing bilateral trade volumes between high-volume partners such as China and the EU." />
